<title>HONG KONG: Allied Banking Corp sets US$50 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Allied Banking Corp sets US$50 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by arranger Standard Chartered Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ALLIED BANKING CORP</p>
<p> AMOUNT     US$50 MLN   COUPON     3ML+75     MATURITY  3 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRCD	  ISS PRICE  PAR	  LAUNCH   24.MAR.97</p>
<p> PUTS	 NONE	  CALLS	NONE	 REPLIES  11.APR.97</p>
<p> LISTING    NONE	  REPAYMENT  BULLET     DENOMS    $100K</p>
<p> RATING     NONE	  SALE LMTS  CUSTOMARY  TAX PROV  --</p>
<p> NEG PLG    --	    CRS DEF    --	   FORCE MAJ --</p>
<p> HOME CTRY  PHILIPPINES GOV LAW    ENGLISH    PAY DATE 25.APR.97</p>
<p> MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>   CO-LEAD MANAGERS   US$5 MLN+    21BP   ALL-IN  82</p>
<p>   SENIOR MANAGERS    US$2-4 MLN   18BP   ALL-IN  81</p>
<p> ARRANGERS   ABN AMRO HOARE GOVETT (NON-ASIAN BOOKS), FUJI</p>
<p>		 INTERNATIONAL FINANCE (HK) (JAPANESE BOOKS) AND</p>
<p>		 STANDARD CHARTERED BANK (ASIAN BOOKS, AGENT)</p>
<p> NOTES    THE ISSUE HAS BEEN FULLY UNDERWRITTEN BY THE</p>
<p>	    ARRANGERS. ISSUED OFF THE BANK'S US$150 MILLION CD</p>
<p>	    PROGRAMME. SIGNING IS SET FOR APRIL 18.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
